{"server":"en","storyId":"main_16_level_spst_16-04","groupId":"main_16","stageId":"spst_16-04","title":"No Way Forward","storyCode":"EG-10","avgTag":"Interlude","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_spst_16-04.txt","sourceHash":"55dfd10e121b14b55ea03761e0030baecda334f7c29f8255c2e25716ffae63eb","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g8_farnorthtundra_aurora"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>Far North Border, Ursus</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected Miner","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Urgh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected Miner","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I can't... run... anymore..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected Miner","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"This is it..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected Miner","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Distant Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Is someone there?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Distant Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"I'll take a look—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Distant Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"No, please let me..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Distant Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"I can sense that it's only a poor soul who has suffered much."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Exhausted, dehydrated, starved..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You're Infected too."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected Miner","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"*cough* *cough*!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Anxious Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"He's one of us, comrades!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Anxious Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Please, save him, just as you saved all of us—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Anxious Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Perform your miracle!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"It's not a miracle..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Oripathy is not the main reason for his pain. I can only stop his illness from tormenting him, but I cannot give him food, clean water, or a safe place to sleep."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I can't perform miracles. I'm not all-powerful. I simply... believe."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Pious Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"You're always so humble. We understand."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"...Can you hear me, sir?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll hold your hand..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"'Believe. Believe in our life.'"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"'Believe in our body and mind, believe every beat of our heart, believe every inhale and exhale.'"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"'Believe that we are the source of all strength.'"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"No longer will you live in fear of death."},{"type":"narration","text":"The pain brought about by the rapid growth of Originium in his body begin to fade.\nHe can still hear the voices, but he is no longer writhing in pain."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected Miner","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Wh-Who are you?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected Miner","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"You saved me..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected Miner","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"*cough* *cough*—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected Miner","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"What can I do to repay you?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You can call me Hierda, like everyone else here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Anxious Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"A miracle—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Anxious Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Hierda has once again saved our comrade!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Anxious Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"She saved all of us! With her motherly caress, she takes away our pain!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Anxious Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Hierda!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Pious Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Hierda."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Many Voices","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Hierda!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected Miner","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Hierda... Hierda."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hierda","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes, that is my name."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected Miner","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"What do you look like? I can't see you clearly, or any of the others..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hierda","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Your head is wounded. Did you fall and hurt yourself?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hierda","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Maybe a mild brain hemorrhage is affecting your vision. Don't worry, we can help you walk..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hierda","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Where are you going?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected Miner","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"I don't know..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hierda","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Then come with us, for now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Pious Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"You're taking us to a place without pain, right?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hierda","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes, as long as you're willing to come with me..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g9_seasurface_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hierda","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"As long as we believe."},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
